      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Postgres \u2014 SOURCE OF TRUTH\n\nusers \u00b7 teams \u00b7 team_members\nchallenges \u00b7 attachments\nsubmissions\n   + scored_value / scored_by\n     (locked-at-solve plugin score)\ninstances (per-team + shared)\napi_tokens (sha-256 hashes)\nevents \u00b7 audit_log",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r_1400",
      "originalText": "Postgres \u2014 SOURCE OF TRUTH\n\nusers \u00b7 teams \u00b7 team_members\nchallenges \u00b7 attachments\nsubmissions\n   + scored_value / scored_by\n     (locked-at-solve plugin score)\ninstances (per-team + shared)\napi_tokens (sha-256 hashes)\nevents \u00b7 audit_log",
