      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Redis \u2014 DERIVED / EPHEMERAL\n\nsession:*        (TTL)\nrate-limit sorted sets\n   register \u00b7 login \u00b7 submit \u00b7 token\nscoreboard:current\nscoreboard:frozen\n   written with SETNX \u2014\n   first writer wins across replicas",
