    {
      "id": "t_1418",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 2187.5,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 195.0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "IN-PROCESS ONLY \u2014 lost on restart, deliberately\n\nWS hub client registry (clients reconnect)\nthe three registries (rebuilt from plugin boot)\nplugin loader state + supervisors\nscheduler per-team locks\nscoreboard lastCount write guard\nfd budget accountant\nargon2id hashing gate\nhandler freeze-state cache\n\nNothing here is a durability risk: each is either\nrebuilt at boot or reconstructible from Postgres.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "r_1416",
      "originalText": "IN-PROCESS ONLY \u2014 lost on restart, deliberately\n\nWS hub client registry (clients reconnect)\nthe three registries (rebuilt from plugin boot)\nplugin loader state + supervisors\nscheduler per-team locks\nscoreboard lastCount write guard\nfd budget accountant\nargon2id hashing gate\nhandler freeze-state cache\n\nNothing here is a durability risk: each is either\nrebuilt at boot or reconstructible from Postgres.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
